  "prefLabel": "Rev 1010.01 Seizure, Forfeiture and Destruction of Illegal Tobacco Products",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1010.01 Seizure, Forfeiture and Destruction of Illegal Tobacco Products.\n\n(a) Proceedings involving the seizure, forfeiture, and destruction of illegal tobacco products pursuant to RSA 78:18 shall be conducted as provided in RSA 78:19 and Rev 207.08.\n\nSource. #10536, eff 3-6-14; ss by #13049, eff 6-4-20 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Rev 1000); ss by #13817, eff 12-1-23 (formerly Rev 1011.01) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Rev 1000)\n\nAPPENDIX",
